[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆さん、集まっていただきありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you all for gathering here today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お礼なんていらないよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No need to thank us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアさんを治したいって気持ちは、\nあたしたちも同じなんだから。ね、プラフタ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We all want to help Valeria get better too. Right, Plachta?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。私やソフィーの知識は治療に役立つはずです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. Our knowledge of alchemy should prove useful in her treatment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ホムンクルスのことならわたしも力になれると思う！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I know a thing or two about homunculi. I'm sure I can help!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この件はオレが求める真理に近い場所にある。\n最後まで見届けさせてもらう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This matter touches upon the truth I seek. I'll see it through to the end."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キースグリフ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keithgriff"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしはどこまでできるか分からないけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm not sure how much help I'll be..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアのことを思うと、\nいても立ってもいられなくってさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I can't just sit around knowing what happened to Valeria."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆さん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000ぜひ、皆さんのお力をお貸しください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Please, lend me your strength!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで、具体的な計画は決まりましたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Have you worked out the specifics of your plan?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。まず、治療の方針について説明させてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. First, let me explain our approach to the treatment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃんたち、どんな様子だった？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How's Resna and the others doing in there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何を話してるのか、ぜんぜん分かんなかったけど、\nみんな、ヴァレリアをどうにかしようって必死みたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Most of what they're saying goes over my head, but everyone seems determined to help Valeria."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれだけの人たちがヴァレリアのために力を尽くして\nくれるなんてさ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To think so many talented people would come together to help Valeria..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "好かれてるね、相棒",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're quite popular, partner."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はい。フロッケは、皆さんを信じます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes. I believe in everyone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだね。だから、私たちも落ち込んでないで、\n前向きに待つことにしようか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. So let's stop moping around and stay positive while we wait."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんで、笑顔でヴァレリアを迎えてやろうよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll greet Valeria with big smiles when she wakes up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろんです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]